  "script": "Four nonprofits just asked a court to freeze frontier AI. The lawsuit was filed in San Francisco Superior Court. The plaintiffs: Irreplaceable Education Fund, Public Citizen, Heat Initiative, Alliance for Secure AI. The defendants: Anthropic, Google, Meta, OpenAI, and SpaceX. They want an emergency injunction. Pause next-generation models. Until companies prove human control. The complaint cites AI cyberattacks. Warnings about rogue behavior. And the companies’ own catastrophic risk admissions. Their argument is blunt. No other industry gets this pass. AI safety is now a legal fight.",
